@page "/help"
<PageTitle>Help | ShoppetCare</PageTitle>
<main class="owner-shell"><header class="owner-header"><span class="owner-eyebrow">A HELPING HAND</span><h1>A few answers for your next step.</h1><p>Find your way around connected pet care, community, and the marketplace.</p></header><section class="owner-card"><h2>Getting started</h2><p>Create a Pet Owner account and use the same email and password on Web and Mobile. Free accounts include one pet and five health records per pet. Feeding routines, community, messaging, and selling are included.</p></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Where do I manage my pet's care?</h2><p>Open My Pets and choose the care journal, or open your pet passport on Mobile. Add vaccination, medication, or checkup records, attach documents, track doses, and update feeding routines. Reopen the other client to see your saved changes.</p><a href="/my-pets">My pets →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>What does a public Pet ID share?</h2><p>The QR code opens a public identity card. Private health records stay protected. Your phone is hidden until you enable public phone visibility under Contacts &amp; care.</p><a href="/account/care">Contacts &amp; care →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Are vet reminders appointments?</h2><p>Reminders are your personal schedule for a visit you arrange directly with a veterinarian. They record the pet, date, purpose, and notes.</p></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Can every Pet Owner sell?</h2><p>Yes. Create a pre-loved listing on Marketplace; edit it or mark it unavailable from your listings. You do not need a seller subscription. Each unique listing has a quantity of one.</p><a href="/marketplace">Marketplace →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>What happens at checkout?</h2><p>Choose a simulated payment outcome. A failed simulation leaves your cart unchanged. A successful checkout saves the completed order and marks the items sold. Arrange the exchange with the seller in Messages. No real payment credentials are collected.</p><a href="/marketplace/orders">Orders →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Does Premium expire?</h2><p>Premium is a ₱49 one-time lifetime upgrade, with unlimited pets and health records. The project uses simulated payments.</p><a href="/premium">Premium →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Can I moderate content?</h2><p>Pet Owners can edit or delete their own posts and listings. Admin accounts can manage users, remove community or marketplace content, and inspect simulated transactions.</p></section></main>
